Near 0.97, local slopes imply 1.01--3.17\% QPS change/$10^{-3}$ recall before snapping. Five-build recall ranges are Vogue/arXiv/OpenAI-1536/3072: 0.0008/0.0012/0.0004/0.0002. This suggests local sensitivity, not a retrained-frontier bound. Cached-model FP32 checks retain OpenAI's advantage (\cref{sec:7-precision}); arXiv/LUT near ties remain inconclusive.

