estimate. Repeat-call ID-order changes can include tied reordering and
exclude no points by themselves; this is distinct from duplicate IDs
within one result. JHQ lacks the same repeat-call diagnostic flag.

\label{sec:a-budget-contract}
\label{sec:a-supplement}
\label{sec:a-t4-t5}
