\[
 L_{95}=L^{\rm sorted}_{\lfloor0.95(64-1)\rfloor}
       =L^{\rm sorted}_{59}\qquad\text{(zero-based)}.
\]
A2's generated instructions and T4's computed-score checks are detailed
in \cref{sec:5-5,sec:7-strict-selection}; small-batch call overhead and
query-quantisation costs follow \cref{sec:7-smallbatch}.

