\Cref{fig:7-frontiers} compares JHQ-GPU with the graph, compressed-IVF
and brute-force baselines of \cref{sec:3-4} \cite{cagra,pq,ivfrabitq},
using the first four datasets in \cref{tab:3-data}. E1 uses batch 1,000/common GT; T5 covers small batches (\cref{sec:7-smallbatch}), with internal ablations in \cref{sec:7-6}.



