Load-only L1 matches L0 bits yet gains $1.368\times$ on arXiv. With lanes at $\alpha=100$, refinement drops 4,277.5$\to$716.8\,$\mu$s ($5.97\times$) versus $1.789\times$ overall. OpenAI-3072 gains $8.81\times$ in-kernel/$1.171\times$ overall. Other stages remain.

For baseline wall-time fraction $f$ and refinement speedup $s$, the replacement model gives
\[
 \frac{T'}T=(1-f)+\frac f s,\qquad
